*Repository:* https://github.com/Lakshmidurga250/Sentine1AI

Please follow these steps on your computer:

*Step 1: Clone the project*

Open PowerShell or VS Code Terminal and run:

powershell
git clone https://github.com/Lakshmidurga250/Sentine1AI.git
cd Sentine1AI


*Step 2: Create your own branch*

Replace your-name with your name:

powershell
git switch -c feature/your-name-contribution


*Step 3: Configure your Git identity*

Use your own name and the email linked to your GitHub account:

powershell
git config user.name "YOUR NAME"
git config user.email "YOUR-GITHUB-EMAIL"


*Step 4: Make a genuine project contribution*

Open the project in VS Code and complete an assigned task. Save your actual changes.

*Step 5: Commit and push your changes*

powershell
git status
git add <your-changed-file>
git commit -m "Describe your actual changes"
git push -u origin feature/your-name-contribution
